 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 A resident walks along a muddy road today following flash floods in Trishuli, Nepal. Photo: Ezra Acayan/Getty Images 🇳🇵🇨🇳 The death toll from catastrophic flooding along the Nepal-China border has reached more than 350, with over 1,300 people still missing. Get the latest . 🛢️ The Trump administration is in talks with Venezuela's interim government about taking an ownership stake in the South American country's enormous oil resources. More from Axios' Marc Caputo . 🇮🇷 Meta removed a network of Facebook and Instagram accounts tied to an Iran-based operation that used AI to target U.S. audiences with posts about American politics, Axios' Sam Sabin is first to report . Go deeper . 🎤 Dolly Parton left behind plans for decades of posthumous releases, Axios Nashville's Adam Tamburin reports. Longtime manager Danny Nozell said: "Dolly worked up until the day she died." Keep reading . 
 
